275
00:15:43,391 --> 00:15:47,391
Yes, we're going to be using the slow-slow beam to stop your captain.

276
00:15:47,391 --> 00:15:49,391
That's our little plan in its entirety.

277
00:15:49,391 --> 00:15:52,391
Heh, not that you're gonna be able to do anything about it.

278
00:15:52,391 --> 00:15:57,391
As if, weren't you paying attention to what happened in the last round?

279
00:15:57,391 --> 00:16:00,391
Operation Laugh and Fall will stop him cold!

280
00:16:00,391 --> 00:16:02,391
Hey, just skate like crazy, Luffy!

281
00:16:02,391 --> 00:16:04,391
Yeah! Leave everything to me!

282
00:16:04,391 --> 00:16:08,391
Okay, it's time to begin the final round!

283
00:16:08,391 --> 00:16:10,391
Ready, go!

284
00:16:15,391 --> 00:16:17,391
No, no! He's starting already!

285
00:16:17,391 --> 00:16:23,391
Family! Family! Family! Family! Family! Family! Family! Family! Family!

286
00:16:23,391 --> 00:16:25,391
Slow-slow beam!

287
00:16:25,391 --> 00:16:30,391
There it is! An onslaught of slow-slow beams!

288
00:16:30,391 --> 00:16:35,391
What's going on? Why isn't Operation Laugh and Fall working?

289
00:16:35,391 --> 00:16:38,391
Eh-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh?

290
00:16:38,391 --> 00:16:41,391
Were you to say something?

291
00:16:41,391 --> 00:16:45,391
Airplugs! The straw half-dangers have been outsmarted!

292
00:16:45,391 --> 00:16:48,391
That's our boss for ya!

293
00:16:48,391 --> 00:16:50,391
Eh! We are screwed!

294
00:16:56,391 --> 00:17:00,391
Uh, what the? Did he just deflect the slow-slow beam?

295
00:17:00,391 --> 00:17:01,391
Oh, you noticed?

296
00:17:01,391 --> 00:17:04,391
Yes, the slow-slow beam doesn't work on Gararine.

297
00:17:04,391 --> 00:17:08,391
What? Really? No way! How is that possible?

298
00:17:08,391 --> 00:17:12,391
Sorry, but it's a secret!

299
00:17:12,391 --> 00:17:15,391
A secret? Oh, that makes perfect sense!

300
00:17:15,391 --> 00:17:17,391
Ah, now I get it.

301
00:17:17,391 --> 00:17:20,391
That's why the rest of your team wasn't on the course.

302
00:17:20,391 --> 00:17:21,391
Yep!

303
00:17:21,391 --> 00:17:25,391
This way, you can't hide from the beam behind any of the boxy devils.

304
00:17:25,391 --> 00:17:29,391
Your whole team is gonna be turned into slow-pokes, but we won't!

305
00:17:30,391 --> 00:17:33,391
This is bad! Now what are we gonna do?

306
00:17:33,391 --> 00:17:36,391
20 seconds are up! Defenders go!

307
00:17:36,391 --> 00:17:41,391
He-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh! Time for you two to slow-down!

308
00:17:41,391 --> 00:17:42,391
Luffy!

309
00:17:43,391 --> 00:17:44,391
No!

310
00:17:46,391 --> 00:17:48,391
Nami! A direct hit!

311
00:17:48,391 --> 00:17:53,391
Navigator Nami and Sniper Usopp have fallen prey to the slow-slow beam!

312
00:17:59,391 --> 00:18:01,391
Luffy! Behind you!

313
00:18:01,391 --> 00:18:06,391
No way! Luffy has been stopped in his tracks!

314
00:18:06,391 --> 00:18:09,391
Victory is now a near-sunday for the back of the devil!

315
00:18:09,391 --> 00:18:12,391
He-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh! Now it's your turn!

316
00:18:12,391 --> 00:18:15,391
There's no way I can dodge his attacks.

317
00:18:15,391 --> 00:18:17,391
If I let that beam hit me, we're done for.

318
00:18:17,391 --> 00:18:19,391
Only one thing to do...

319
00:18:19,391 --> 00:18:20,391
Here, let's move a bit.

320
00:18:20,391 --> 00:18:27,391
Aye-he-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh, heuh-heh-heh-heh-heh-lops.

321
00:18:28,391 --> 00:18:29,391
Heee-heh!

322
00:18:29,391 --> 00:18:31,391
Oh, what's this?!

323
00:18:31,391 --> 00:18:39,391
Niko-robin, who has been keeping the Straw Hat dangers in the game, has suddenly given up?

324
00:18:39,391 --> 00:18:45,391
With only one minute remaining in the round, she has stepped off the course!

325
00:18:45,391 --> 00:18:48,611
The effects of the slow, slow beam last for 30 seconds.

326
00:18:49,411 --> 00:18:52,951
If Luffy can dodge the next attack, he'll still have a chance to win.

327
00:18:53,691 --> 00:18:55,071
Failure is not an option.

328
00:18:55,791 --> 00:18:57,691
I have to wait for just the right moment.

329
00:18:59,671 --> 00:19:01,591
Robin, what are you doing?

330
00:19:02,631 --> 00:19:06,091
If I'm over here with you two, I can avoid being hit by that beam, right?

331
00:19:06,871 --> 00:19:09,691
Hmm? Yeah, but...

332
00:19:09,691 --> 00:19:14,431
40 seconds remain, and Girarin has an easy three-lap lead!

333
00:19:15,391 --> 00:19:16,391
What?

334
00:19:20,271 --> 00:19:24,251
Think I'll give you two another dose just to be on the safe side.

335
00:19:24,571 --> 00:19:27,111
Feed, feed, feed, feed, feed, feed...

336
00:19:27,111 --> 00:19:34,271
Alright, Straw Hat Luffy, it's been a lot of fun, but now it's time to end this.

337
00:19:34,551 --> 00:19:36,231
Feed, feed, feed, feed, feed...

338
00:19:36,231 --> 00:19:37,991
Only 30 seconds remain!

339
00:19:38,351 --> 00:19:43,131
If Straw Hat Luffy is hit with another beam, victory for the Foxy Devils is guaranteed!

340
00:19:43,131 --> 00:19:45,131
Luffy!

341
00:19:51,131 --> 00:19:53,131
This ends now!

342
00:20:02,131 --> 00:20:03,131
Oh, crap!

343
00:20:03,131 --> 00:20:05,131
Luffy, move it!

344
00:20:05,131 --> 00:20:07,131
Get going!

345
00:20:07,131 --> 00:20:09,131
Right!

346
00:20:09,131 --> 00:20:13,131
20 seconds!

347
00:20:19,131 --> 00:20:22,131
Mucha-kara!

348
00:20:28,131 --> 00:20:30,131
So, how should I prepare you?

349
00:20:30,131 --> 00:20:32,131
Grilled or deep-fried?

350
00:20:39,131 --> 00:20:43,131
10 seconds left!

351
00:20:43,131 --> 00:20:45,131
Straw Hat Luffy is moving at incredible speed!

352
00:20:45,131 --> 00:20:47,131
These two are neck and neck now,

353
00:20:47,131 --> 00:20:49,131
and it'll be a mad dash for the finish!

354
00:20:51,131 --> 00:20:53,131
No!

355
00:20:53,131 --> 00:20:55,131
You wouldn't!

356
00:20:59,131 --> 00:21:01,131
The boss has slowed himself down!

357
00:21:01,131 --> 00:21:02,131
Calm down!

358
00:21:06,131 --> 00:21:07,131
Only five seconds left!

359
00:21:08,131 --> 00:21:10,131
Those stalled blades won't work on me!

360
00:21:14,131 --> 00:21:15,131
Huh?

361
00:21:21,131 --> 00:21:22,131
Yeah!

362
00:21:22,131 --> 00:21:24,131
The Strut Hat Danger's advantage of all of them

363
00:21:24,131 --> 00:21:27,131
will come from behind the game!

364
00:21:27,131 --> 00:21:29,131
Yeah!

365
00:21:30,131 --> 00:21:31,131
Yeah!

366
00:21:31,131 --> 00:22:01,111
We'll be right back.

367
00:23:06,218 --> 00:23:09,518
Next, Wood Piece, screaming hot bombardment,

368
00:23:09,518 --> 00:23:13,018
Pirate Dodgeball, I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

